    <div begin="00:29.350" end="03:37.040">
      <p begin="00:29.350" end="00:30.830" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="00:29.350" end="00:29.550">Be</span><span begin="00:29.550" end="00:29.760">yond</span> <span begin="00:29.840" end="00:30.190">si</span><span begin="00:30.190" end="00:30.290">lent</span> <span begin="00:30.290" end="00:30.420">s</span><span begin="00:30.420" end="00:30.750">kie</span><span begin="00:30.750" end="00:30.830">s</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">越过寂静的天空</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">越過寂靜的天空</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">静かな空の彼方から</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">고요한 하늘 너머</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Au-delà des cieux silencieux</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Más allá de los cielos silenciosos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Jenseits stiller Himmel</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Além dos céus silenciosos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">За безмолвными небесами</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Oltre cieli silenziosi</span></p>
      <p begin="00:31.050" end="00:32.990" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:31.050" end="00:31.310">Cal</span><span begin="00:31.310" end="00:31.510">ling</span> <span begin="00:31.610" end="00:31.950">out</span> <span begin="00:31.950" end="00:32.100">to</span> <span begin="00:32.190" end="00:32.990">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">呼唤着你</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">呼喚著你</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">君へと呼びかける</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">너를 향해 부르고 있어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je t’appelle</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Llamándote</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Rufe ich nach dir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Chamando por você</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я зову тебя</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Chiamando te</span></p>
      <p begin="00:36.210" end="00:37.570" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:36.210" end="00:36.330">Through</span> <span begin="00:36.420" end="00:36.740">the</span> <span begin="00:36.740" end="00:36.950">en</span><span begin="00:37.040" end="00:37.070">d</span><span begin="00:37.070" end="00:37.160">le</span><span begin="00:37.160" end="00:37.290">ss</span> <span begin="00:37.290" end="00:37.570">blue</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">穿过无尽的蔚蓝</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">穿過無盡的蔚藍</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">果てしない青を越えて</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">끝없이 펼쳐진 푸름을 지나</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">À travers l’azur sans fin</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">A través del azul infinito</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Durch das endlose Blau</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Através do azul sem fim</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Сквозь бескрайнюю синеву</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Attraverso l'azzurro infinito</span></p>
      <p begin="00:37.900" end="00:39.940" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:37.900" end="00:38.170">Car</span><span begin="00:38.170" end="00:38.370">rying</span> <span begin="00:38.460" end="00:38.780">what</span> <span begin="00:38.780" end="00:38.880">is</span> <span begin="00:39.010" end="00:39.940">true</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">带着那份真实</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">帶著那份真實</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">確かな想いを携えて</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">진실한 마음을 품고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Emportant avec moi ce qui est vrai</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Llevando conmigo lo que es verdad</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Trage ich was wahr ist</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Levando aquilo que é verdadeiro</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Неся с собой то что истинно</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Portando con me ciò che è vero</span></p>
      <p begin="00:43.060" end="00:44.580" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:43.060" end="00:43.130">A</span><span begin="00:43.230" end="00:43.460">cro</span><span begin="00:43.460" end="00:43.610">ss</span> <span begin="00:43.610" end="00:43.930">qui</span><span begin="00:43.930" end="00:44.020">et</span> <span begin="00:44.150" end="00:44.510">nigh</span><span begin="00:44.510" end="00:44.580">ts</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">越过静谧的夜晚</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">越過靜謐的夜晚</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">静かな夜を越えて</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">고요한 밤들을 건너</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">À travers les nuits paisibles</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">A través de noches serenas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Durch stille Nächte</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Através das noites tranquilas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Сквозь тихие ночи</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Attraverso notti tranquille</span></p>
      <p begin="00:44.750" end="00:46.500" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:44.750" end="00:44.990">Hol</span><span begin="00:44.990" end="00:45.150">ding</span> <span begin="00:45.280" end="00:45.570">e</span><span begin="00:45.570" end="00:45.640">ve</span><span begin="00:45.640" end="00:45.770">ry</span> <span begin="00:45.850" end="00:46.500">word</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">珍藏着每一句话</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">珍藏著每一句話</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">一つ一つの言葉を抱いて</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">모든 말을 품은 채</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Gardant précieusement chaque mot</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Guardando cada palabra</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Bewahre ich jedes Wort</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Guardando cada palavra</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Храня каждое слово</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Custodendo ogni parola</span></p>
      <p begin="00:49.880" end="00:51.400" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:49.880" end="00:49.990">Through</span> <span begin="00:50.120" end="00:50.320">the</span> <span begin="00:50.440" end="00:50.800">fa</span><span begin="00:50.800" end="00:50.920">ding</span> <span begin="00:51.010" end="00:51.360">dar</span><span begin="00:51.360" end="00:51.400">k</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">穿过渐渐消退的黑暗</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">穿過漸漸消退的黑暗</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">薄れゆく闇の中でも</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">희미해지는 어둠을 지나</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">À travers l’obscurité qui s’efface</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">A través de la oscuridad que se desvanece</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Durch die schwindende Dunkelheit</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Através da escuridão que se desfaz</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Сквозь угасающую тьму</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Attraverso l'oscurità che svanisce</span></p>
      <p begin="00:51.570" end="00:55.270" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:51.570" end="00:51.640">S</span><span begin="00:51.640" end="00:51.860">till</span> <span begin="00:51.860" end="00:52.090">rea</span><span begin="00:52.180" end="00:52.430">ching</span> <span begin="00:52.710" end="00:53.370">out</span> <span begin="00:53.760" end="00:54.120">to</span> <span begin="00:54.200" end="00:55.270">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">依然向你伸出手</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">依然向你伸出手</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">今も君へと手を伸ばしている</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">여전히 너에게 손을 뻗고 있어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je tends encore la main vers toi</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Aún intentando llegar hasta ti</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Strecke ich noch immer die Hand nach dir aus</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Ainda estendendo a mão até você</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я всё ещё тянусь к тебе</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Continuando a tendere la mano verso di te</span></p>
      <p begin="00:56.940" end="00:59.420" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="00:56.940" end="00:57.660">Hear</span><span begin="00:57.660" end="00:57.760">ts</span> <span begin="00:57.850" end="00:58.320">un</span><span begin="00:58.450" end="00:59.420">tied</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心结已解</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">心結已解</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">心は解き放たれ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">마음은 자유로워지고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Les cœurs libérés</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Corazones liberados</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Die Herzen sind befreit</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Corações enfim livres</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Сердца освободились</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Cuori ormai liberi</span></p>
      <p begin="01:00.220" end="01:02.810" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="01:00.220" end="01:00.410">S</span><span begin="01:00.410" end="01:01.060">car</span><span begin="01:01.060" end="01:01.260">s</span> <span begin="01:01.260" end="01:01.770">run</span> <span begin="01:01.880" end="01:02.810">dry</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">伤口不再流血</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">傷口不再流血</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">傷痕も乾いてゆく</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">상처도 이제 말라 가</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Les cicatrices ne saignent plus</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Las heridas ya se han secado</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Die Narben bluten nicht mehr</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">As cicatrizes já secaram</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Шрамы больше не кровоточат</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Le ferite non sanguinano più</span></p>
      <p begin="01:03.810" end="01:06.610" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="01:03.810" end="01:04.510">Now</span> <span begin="01:04.680" end="01:05.220">I</span> <span begin="01:05.320" end="01:05.770">can</span> <span begin="01:05.960" end="01:06.610">say</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如今我终于能够说出</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">如今我終於能夠說出</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">今なら言える</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이제는 말할 수 있어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Maintenant je peux le dire</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Ahora puedo decirlo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Jetzt kann ich sagen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Agora posso dizer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Теперь я могу сказать</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ora posso dirlo</span></p>
      <p begin="01:07.280" end="01:09.790" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="01:07.280" end="01:07.560">No</span><span begin="01:07.690" end="01:07.940">thing</span> <span begin="01:08.120" end="01:08.750">pull</span><span begin="01:08.750" end="01:08.800">s</span> <span begin="01:08.800" end="01:08.920">u</span><span begin="01:08.920" end="01:09.020">s a</span><span begin="01:09.020" end="01:09.790">way</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再没有什么能将我们分开</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">再沒有什麼能將我們分開</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">もう何も僕らを引き離せない</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그 무엇도 우리를 떼어 놓을 수 없어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Plus rien ne peut nous éloigner</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Nada puede separarnos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Nichts reißt uns auseinander</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Nada pode nos afastar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ничто нас не разлучит</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Nulla può separarci</span></p>
      <p begin="01:10.260" end="01:13.190" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="01:10.260" end="01:10.690">We</span> <span begin="01:10.690" end="01:11.340">will</span> <span begin="01:11.340" end="01:12.000">let</span> <span begin="01:12.000" end="01:12.090">it</span> <span begin="01:12.190" end="01:13.190">go</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就让它离去吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">就讓它離去吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">僕らは手放してゆく</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우린 이제 놓아줄 거야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Nous laisserons tout partir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Lo dejaremos ir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wir werden es loslassen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Vamos deixar tudo ir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Мы отпустим всё</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Lasceremo andare tutto</span></p>
      <p begin="01:13.660" end="01:16.550" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="01:13.660" end="01:14.110">We</span> <span begin="01:14.110" end="01:14.650">will</span> <span begin="01:14.760" end="01:15.280">dri</span><span begin="01:15.280" end="01:15.430">f</span><span begin="01:15.430" end="01:15.640">t a</span><span begin="01:15.640" end="01:16.550">way</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就这样漂向远方</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">就這樣漂向遠方</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">僕らは漂ってゆく</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우린 흘러가겠지</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Nous nous laisserons dériver</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Nos dejaremos llevar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wir werden davontreiben</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Vamos nos deixar levar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Мы уплывём вдаль</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ci lasceremo trasportare</span></p>
      <p begin="01:17.520" end="01:23.520" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="01:17.520" end="01:19.220">空</span><span begin="01:19.220" end="01:20.010">へ</span><span begin="01:20.120" end="01:20.910">と</span><span begin="01:21.600" end="01:21.910">溶</span><span begin="01:22.040" end="01:22.320">け</span><span begin="01:22.460" end="01:22.740">て</span><span begin="01:22.740" end="01:22.810">い</span><span begin="01:22.910" end="01:23.520">く</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">渐渐融入天空</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">漸漸融入天空</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Melting into the sky</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">하늘로 녹아들어 가</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Nous nous fondrons dans le ciel</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Nos fundiremos con el cielo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Und uns im Himmel auflösen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Dissolvendo-nos no céu</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Растворяясь в небе</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Sciogliendoci nel cielo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Sora e to tokete iku</span></p>
      <p begin="01:23.960" end="01:26.870" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="01:23.960" end="01:24.420">We</span> <span begin="01:24.420" end="01:25.070">will</span> <span begin="01:25.070" end="01:25.730">let</span> <span begin="01:25.730" end="01:25.830">it</span> <span begin="01:25.940" end="01:26.870">go</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就让它离去吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">就讓它離去吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">僕らは手放してゆく</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우린 이제 놓아줄 거야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Nous laisserons tout partir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Lo dejaremos ir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wir werden es loslassen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Vamos deixar tudo ir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Мы отпустим всё</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Lasceremo andare tutto</span></p>
      <p begin="01:27.380" end="01:30.730" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17"><span begin="01:27.380" end="01:27.840">We</span> <span begin="01:27.840" end="01:28.360">will</span> <span begin="01:28.460" end="01:28.790">dri</span><span begin="01:28.790" end="01:28.930">f</span><span begin="01:28.930" end="01:29.210">t a</span><span begin="01:29.320" end="01:29.680">way</span> <span begin="01:29.760" end="01:29.870">to</span><span begin="01:29.980" end="01:30.410">ge</span><span begin="01:30.410" end="01:30.730">ther</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们会一同漂向远方</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我們會一同漂向遠方</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">僕らは共に漂ってゆく</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우린 함께 흘러가겠지</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Nous nous laisserons dériver ensemble</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Nos dejaremos llevar juntos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wir werden gemeinsam davontreiben</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Vamos nos deixar levar juntos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Мы уплывём вдаль вместе</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ci lasceremo trasportare insieme</span></p>
      <p begin="01:31.070" end="01:37.130" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18"><span begin="01:31.070" end="01:32.130">旅</span><span begin="01:32.130" end="01:32.940">の</span><span begin="01:32.940" end="01:33.530">果</span><span begin="01:33.610" end="01:33.730">て</span><span begin="01:33.840" end="01:34.590">で</span><span begin="01:35.110" end="01:35.830">伝</span><span begin="01:35.830" end="01:36.120">え</span><span begin="01:36.220" end="01:36.480">る</span><span begin="01:36.480" end="01:36.630">ん</span><span begin="01:36.630" end="01:37.130">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我要在旅途的尽头告诉你</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我要在旅途的盡頭告訴你</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I'll tell you at the journey's end</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">여행의 끝에서 전할 거야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Au bout du voyage je te le dirai</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Te lo diré al final del viaje</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Am Ende der Reise werde ich es dir sagen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Vou contar tudo no fim da jornada</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И в конце пути я расскажу об этом</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Te lo dirò alla fine del viaggio</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Tabi no hate de tsutaerunda</span></p>
      <p begin="01:51.610" end="01:53.110" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19"><span begin="01:51.610" end="01:51.850">Be</span><span begin="01:51.850" end="01:52.070">yond</span> <span begin="01:52.170" end="01:52.340">di</span><span begin="01:52.340" end="01:52.500">s</span><span begin="01:52.500" end="01:52.720">tant</span> <span begin="01:52.720" end="01:53.000">day</span><span begin="01:53.000" end="01:53.110">s</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">越过遥远的岁月</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">越過遙遠的歲月</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">遠い日々の彼方でも</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">아득히 멀어진 날들 너머</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Au-delà des jours lointains</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Más allá de aquellos días lejanos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Jenseits ferner Tage</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Além dos dias distantes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">За далёкими днями</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Oltre giorni lontani</span></p>
      <p begin="01:53.330" end="01:57.390" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20"><span begin="01:53.330" end="01:53.560">Hol</span><span begin="01:53.560" end="01:53.720">ding</span> <span begin="01:53.860" end="01:54.120">on</span><span begin="01:54.220" end="01:54.450">to</span> <span begin="01:54.450" end="01:55.270">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仍将你放在心上</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">仍將你放在心上</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">君を離さずに</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">여전히 너를 붙잡은 채</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je m’accroche encore à toi</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Aferrándome a ti</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Halte ich an dir fest</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Ainda me apegando a você</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я всё ещё держусь за тебя</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Restando aggrappato a te</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="01:55.090" end="01:57.390"><span begin="01:55.090" end="01:55.270">(No</span> <span begin="01:55.270" end="01:55.500">mat</span><span begin="01:55.500" end="01:55.730">ter</span> <span begin="01:55.940" end="01:56.220">where</span> <span begin="01:56.320" end="01:56.540">you</span> <span begin="01:56.540" end="01:57.390">are)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论你身在何方</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">無論你身在何方</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">君がどこにいても</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">네가 어디에 있든</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Peu importe où tu es</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">No importa dónde estés</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ganz gleich wo du bist</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Não importa onde você esteja</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Где бы ты ни был</s