      <p begin="01:58.510" end="02:00.020" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21"><span begin="01:58.510" end="01:58.580">A</span><span begin="01:58.720" end="01:58.910">mid</span> <span begin="01:59.000" end="01:59.200">shi</span><span begin="01:59.200" end="01:59.250">f</span><span begin="01:59.330" end="01:59.430">ting</span> <span begin="01:59.580" end="01:59.850">tide</span><span begin="01:59.850" end="02:00.020">s</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">置身不断变幻的潮汐之中</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">置身不斷變幻的潮汐之中</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">移ろう潮の中で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">변해 가는 물결 속에서도</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Au milieu des marées changeantes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Entre mareas cambiantes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Inmitten wechselnder Gezeiten</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Em meio às marés que mudam</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Среди меняющихся течений</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Tra maree mutevoli</span></p>
      <p begin="02:00.220" end="02:04.590" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22"><span begin="02:00.220" end="02:00.340">Kee</span><span begin="02:00.440" end="02:00.610">ping</span> <span begin="02:00.710" end="02:00.900">some</span><span begin="02:01.060" end="02:01.160">thing</span> <span begin="02:01.290" end="02:02.140">true</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仍守着那份真实</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">仍守著那份真實</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">変わらない想いを抱いて</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">변치 않는 무언가를 간직하며</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Gardant quelque chose de vrai</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Conservando algo verdadero</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Bewahre ich etwas Wahres</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Guardando algo verdadeiro</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Храня нечто истинное</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Custodendo qualcosa di vero</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="02:01.960" end="02:04.590"><span begin="02:01.960" end="02:02.050">(The</span> <span begin="02:02.180" end="02:02.420">wor</span><span begin="02:02.420" end="02:02.470">ds</span> <span begin="02:02.570" end="02:02.660">I</span> <span begin="02:02.800" end="02:03.020">kept</span> <span begin="02:03.190" end="02:03.630">for</span> <span begin="02:03.630" end="02:04.590">you)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">守着那些为你留下的话语</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">守著那些為你留下的話語</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">君のためにしまっていた言葉を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">너를 위해 남겨 둔 말들을</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ces mots que j’ai gardés pour toi</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Las palabras que guardé para ti</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Die Worte die ich für dich bewahrt habe</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">As palavras que guardei para você</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Слова что я берегла для тебя</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Le parole che ho conservato per te</span></span></p>
      <p begin="02:05.290" end="02:06.740" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23"><span begin="02:05.290" end="02:05.450">Through</span> <span begin="02:05.560" end="02:05.770">the</span> <span begin="02:05.910" end="02:06.230">mor</span><span begin="02:06.230" end="02:06.440">ning</span> <span begin="02:06.440" end="02:06.740">light</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">穿过清晨的微光</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">穿過清晨的微光</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">朝の光を越えて</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">아침빛을 지나</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">À travers la lumière du matin</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">A través de la luz de la mañana</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Durch das Licht des Morgens</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Através da luz da manhã</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Сквозь утренний свет</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Attraverso la luce del mattino</span></p>
