      <p begin="02:15.790" end="02:21.960" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26"><span begin="02:15.790" end="02:16.550">Right</span> <span begin="02:16.670" end="02:17.250">where</span> <span begin="02:17.340" end="02:17.640">it</span> <span begin="02:17.760" end="02:18.190">be</span><span begin="02:18.420" end="02:21.870">long</span><span begin="02:21.870" end="02:21.960">s</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">去往它们应归之处</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">去往它們應歸之處</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">あるべき場所へ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그 말들이 있어야 할 바로 그곳으로</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Jusqu’à l’endroit où il devait être</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Justo adonde pertenece</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Genau dorthin wo es hingehört</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Exatamente para onde ela pertence</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Туда где ему и место</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Proprio dove deve stare</span></p>
      <p begin="02:32.370" end="02:35.350" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27"><span begin="02:32.370" end="02:32.540">S</span><span begin="02:32.540" end="02:32.990">till</span> <span begin="02:32.990" end="02:33.420">I</span> <span begin="02:33.610" end="02:34.030">can</span> <span begin="02:34.030" end="02:34.400">hear</span> <span begin="02:34.500" end="02:35.350">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我依然能够听见你</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我依然能夠聽見你</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">今も君の声が聞こえる</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">지금도 네 목소리가 들려</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je peux encore t’entendre</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Aún puedo oírte</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Noch immer kann ich dich hören</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Ainda consigo ouvir você</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я всё ещё слышу тебя</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Eppure riesco ancora a sentirti</span></p>
      <p begin="02:35.920" end="02:38.790" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28"><span begin="02:35.920" end="02:36.190">A</span><span begin="02:36.360" end="02:36.750">cro</span><span begin="02:36.750" end="02:36.910">ss</span> <span begin="02:37.070" end="02:37.400">e</span><span begin="02:37.400" end="02:37.510">ve</span><span begin="02:37.510" end="02:37.730">ry</span> <span begin="02:37.890" end="02:37.950">b</span><span begin="02:37.950" end="02:38.790">lue</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">越过每一片蔚蓝</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">越過每一片蔚藍</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">どこまでも続く青の彼方から</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">끝없이 펼쳐진 푸름 너머로</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Par-delà tous les horizons d’azur</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">A través de todo ese azul</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Über jedes Blau hinweg</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Através de todo esse azul</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Сквозь всю эту синеву</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Attraverso ogni distesa d'azzurro</span></p>
      <p begin="02:39.400" end="02:42.110" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29"><span begin="02:39.400" end="02:39.870">Though</span> <span begin="02:39.870" end="02:40.200">we</span> <span begin="02:40.520" end="02:40.780">are</span> <span begin="02:40.910" end="02:41.190">far</span> <span begin="02:41.350" end="02:42.110">now</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使如今我们相隔遥远</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">即使如今我們相隔遙遠</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">今は遠く離れていても</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">지금은 서로 멀리 떨어져 있어도</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Même si nous sommes loin désormais</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Aunque ahora estemos lejos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Auch wenn wir jetzt weit voneinander entfernt sind</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Embora agora estejamos distantes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Пусть теперь мы далеко друг от друга</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Anche se ora siamo lontani</span></p>
      <p begin="02:42.840" end="02:45.800" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30"><span begin="02:42.840" end="02:43.260">My</span> <span begin="02:43.260" end="02:43.680">voi</span><span begin="02:43.680" end="02:43.780">ce</span> <span begin="02:43.960" end="02:44.190">rea</span><span begin="02:44.320" end="02:44.610">che</span><span begin="02:44.610" end="02:44.750">s</span> <span begin="02:44.750" end="02:45.800">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的声音依然能够抵达你</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我的聲音依然能夠抵達你</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">僕の声は君へ届く</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">내 목소리는 너에게 닿아</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ma voix parvient jusqu’à toi</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Mi voz llega hasta ti</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Erreicht dich meine Stimme</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Minha voz chega até você</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Мой голос достигает тебя</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">La mia voce arriva fino a te</span></p>
      <p begin="02:46.250" end="02:49.020" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31"><span begin="02:46.250" end="02:46.710">We</span> <span begin="02:46.710" end="02:47.370">will</span> <span begin="02:47.370" end="02:47.970">let</span> <span begin="02:47.970" end="02:48.120">it</span> <span begin="02:48.210" end="02:49.020">go</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就让它离去吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">就讓它離去吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">僕らは手放してゆく</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우린 이제 놓아줄 거야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Nous laisserons tout partir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Lo dejaremos ir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wir werden es loslassen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Vamos deixar tudo ir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Мы отпустим всё</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Lasceremo andare tutto</span></p>
      <p begin="02:49.680" end="02:52.400" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32"><span begin="02:49.680" end="02:50.130">We</span> <span begin="02:50.130" end="02:50.590">will</span> <span begin="02:50.720" end="02:51.260">dri</span><span begin="02:51.260" end="02:51.380">f</span><span begin="02:51.380" end="02:51.600">t a</span><span begin="02:51.600" end="02:52.400">way</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就这样漂向远方</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">就這樣漂向遠方</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">僕らは漂ってゆく</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우린 흘러가겠지</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Nous nous laisserons dériver</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Nos dejaremos llevar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wir werden davontreiben</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Vamos nos deixar levar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Мы уплывём вдаль</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ci lasceremo trasportare</span></p>
      <p begin="02:53.310" end="02:55.880" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33"><span begin="02:53.310" end="02:53.390">気</span><span begin="02:53.540" end="02:54.280">づ</span><span begin="02:54.280" end="02:54.330">い</span><span begin="02:54.460" end="02:54.910">た</span><span begin="02:54.910" end="02:55.060">ん</span><span begin="02:55.060" end="02:55.880">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我终于明白了</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我終於明白了</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I finally realized</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이제야 깨달았어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je l’ai enfin compris</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Me di cuenta</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Jetzt habe ich es verstanden</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Eu finalmente percebi</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Теперь я поняла</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">L'ho capito</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kizuitanda</span></p>
      <p begin="02:56.540" end="02:59.460" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34"><span begin="02:56.540" end="02:56.830">No</span><span begin="02:56.920" end="02:57.250">thing</span> <span begin="02:57.250" end="02:57.410">s</span><span begin="02:57.410" end="02:57.710">tan</span><span begin="02:57.710" end="02:57.840">ds</span> <span begin="02:57.840" end="02:58.170">in</span> <span begin="02:58.260" end="02:58.560">the</span> <span begin="02:58.660" end="02:59.460">way</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再没有什么能够阻挡我们</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">再沒有什麼能夠阻擋我們</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">もう何も行く手を阻めない</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그 무엇도 앞을 가로막지 않아</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Plus rien ne se dresse sur notre chemin</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Nada se interpone en el camino</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Nichts steht uns im Weg</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Nada está em nosso caminho</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ничто не преградит нам путь</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Nulla può ostacolarci</span></p>
      <p begin="02:59.960" end="03:02.910" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35"><span begin="02:59.960" end="03:00.400">We</span> <span begin="03:00.400" end="03:01.060">will</span> <span begin="03:01.060" end="03:01.710">let</span> <span begin="03:01.710" end="03:01.810">it</span> <span begin="03:01.910" end="03:02.910">go</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就让它离去吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">就讓它離去吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">僕らは手放してゆく</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우린 이제 놓아줄 거야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Nous laisserons tout partir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Lo dejaremos ir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wir werden es loslassen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Vamos deixar tudo ir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Мы отпустим всё</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Lasceremo andare tutto</span></p>
      <p begin="03:03.350" end="03:06.280" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36"><span begin="03:03.350" end="03:03.820">We</span> <span begin="03:03.820" end="03:04.370">will</span> <span begin="03:04.460" end="03:04.980">dri</span><span begin="03:04.980" end="03:05.150">f</span><span begin="03:05.150" end="03:05.360">t a</span><span begin="03:05.360" end="03:06.280">way</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就这样漂向远方</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">就這樣漂向遠方</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">僕らは漂ってゆく</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우린 흘러가겠지</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Nous nous laisserons dériver</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Nos dejaremos llevar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wir werden davontreiben</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Vamos nos deixar levar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Мы уплывём вдаль</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ci lasceremo trasportare</span></p>
      <p begin="03:07.250" end="03:13.210" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37"><span begin="03:07.250" end="03:08.930">空</span><span begin="03:08.930" end="03:09.710">へ</span><span begin="03:09.830" end="03:10.630">と</span><span begin="03:11.310" end="03:11.610">溶</span><span begin="03:11.760" end="03:12.030">け</span><span begin="03:12.180" end="03:12.460">て</span><span begin="03:12.460" end="03:12.520">い</span><span begin="03:12.610" end="03:13.210">く</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">渐渐融入天空</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">漸漸融入天空</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Melting into the sky</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">하늘로 녹아들어 가</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Nous nous fondrons dans le ciel</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Nos fundiremos con el cielo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Und uns im Himmel auflösen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Dissolvendo-nos no céu</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Растворяясь в небе</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Sciogliendoci nel cielo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Sora e to tokete iku</span></p>
      <p begin="03:13.660" end="03:16.580" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38"><span begin="03:13.660" end="03:14.120">We</span> <span begin="03:14.120" end="03:14.780">will</span> <span begin="03:14.780" end="03:15.440">let</span> <span begin="03:15.440" end="03:15.550">it</span> <span begin="03:15.670" end="03:16.580">go</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就让它离去吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">就讓它離去吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">僕らは手放してゆく</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우린 이제 놓아줄 거야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Nous laisserons tout partir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Lo dejaremos ir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wir werden es loslassen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Vamos deixar tudo ir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Мы отпустим всё</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Lasceremo andare tutto</span></p>
      <p begin="03:17.090" end="03:20.440" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39"><span begin="03:17.090" end="03:17.550">We</span> <span begin="03:17.550" end="03:18.060">will</span> <span begin="03:18.150" end="03:18.500">dri</span><span begin="03:18.500" end="03:18.620">f</span><span begin="03:18.620" end="03:18.920">t a</span><span begin="03:19.040" end="03:19.390">way</span> <span begin="03:19.480" end="03:19.590">to</span><span begin="03:19.700" end="03:20.120">ge</span><span begin="03:20.120" end="03:20.440">ther</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们会一同漂向远方</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我們會一同漂向遠方</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">僕らは共に漂ってゆく</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우린 함께 흘러가겠지</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Nous nous laisserons dériver ensemble</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Nos dejaremos llevar juntos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wir werden gemeinsam davontreiben</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Vamos nos deixar levar juntos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Мы уплывём вдаль вместе</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ci lasceremo trasportare insieme</span></p>
      <p begin="03:20.780" end="03:30.230" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40"><span begin="03:20.780" end="03:21.840">旅</span><span begin="03:21.840" end="03:22.660">の</span><span begin="03:22.660" end="03:23.240">果</span><span begin="03:23.330" end="03:23.450">て</span><span begin="03:23.540" end="03:24.310">で</span> <span begin="03:24.810" end="03:25.470">君</span><span begin="03:25.470" end="03:25.590">に</span><span begin="03:25.680" end="03:26.220">届</span><span begin="03:26.330" end="03:26.840">け</span><span begin="03:26.960" end="03:30.230">よう</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在旅途的尽头 将这一切传达给你</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">在旅途的盡頭 將這一切傳達給你</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">At the journey's end I'll send it to you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">여행의 끝에서 너에게 전할게</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Au bout du voyage je ferai en sorte que ces mots te parviennent</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Al final del viaje haré que llegue hasta ti</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Am Ende der Reise werde ich es dir übermitteln</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">No fim da jornada farei isso chegar até você</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И в конце пути я донесу это до тебя</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Alla fine del viaggio farò in modo che ti raggiunga</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Tabi no hate de kimi ni todokeyou</span></p>
      <p begin="03:31.910" end="03:37.040" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41"><span begin="03:31.910" end="03:32.280">Right</span> <span begin="03:32.360" end="03:32.800">where</span> <span begin="03:32.800" end="03:33.110">we</span> <span begin="03:33.220" end="03:33.770">be</span><span begin="03:33.850" end="03:37.040">long</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就在我们应归之处</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">就在我們應歸之處</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">僕らがいるべき場所へ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우리가 있어야 할 바로 그곳에서</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Là exactement où est notre place</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Justo donde debemos estar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Genau dort wo wir hingehören</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Exatamente onde pertencemos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Там где нам и место</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Proprio dove apparteniamo</span></p>
    </div>
  </body>
</tt>
